  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Please Help Royal &amp; Friends</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">After months and years of cruelty and neglect, a lucky dozen have been chosen to fly to the US this December for a chance to live in a warm home this holiday season. Some have been living at the shelter for over 3 years.  Each one is an abuse victim, but most importantly they are SURVIVORS. They deserve a better life., and this flight is the key to their happiness.  PLEASE help them ring in the New Year in a loving home for once.</narrative>
  </description>
